2. Build and run it on your own machines to evaluate it or to test a change you are proposing to
   this repository.

What you may not do without written permission from the copyright holder

1. Use the code, the course content, the generated audio, the artwork or the documentation, in
   whole or in part, in any other product, service, course, dataset or app, commercial or not.
2. Distribute it, or a modified version of it, other than as a fork on GitHub for the purposes
   above or as a pull request to this repository.
3. Publish the app, or a build of it, to any app store or to the web.
4. Use the name "Loro", its icon or its artwork to identify anything other than this project.

